Customer registers → logs in → submits project details → uploads project documents → adds billing and delivery addresses → submits enquiry → admin reviews → admin generates quotation → customer accepts quotation → customer pays advance → payment is verified → project is created → engineer is assigned → progress is updated → project is delivered.

