Customer logs in → opens 3D printing page → uploads STL/OBJ/3MF model → model is validated → 3D preview appears → customer selects technology → selects material → selects colour → configures print settings → backend slicer generates estimate → pricing is calculated → customer enters delivery address → customer pays → payment is verified → printing order is created → admin schedules printing → printing and inspection are completed → order is shipped → customer receives product.

### Workflow C: Ready-made product purchase

Customer opens shop → searches product → opens product detail page → selects variant → adds to cart → enters delivery address → checks order summary → pays using Razorpay → payment is verified → inventory is updated → admin processes order → shipment is created → customer tracks order → order is delivered.

