Admin logs in → adds category → adds product → uploads images → enters technical specifications → sets price → sets stock → publishes product → customer can see and purchase it.

### Workflow E: Admin 3D printing management

Admin configures machines → adds materials → configures colours → sets machine rates → manages slicing jobs → reviews orders → manages production → updates order status → updates shipment.

### Workflow F: B2B quotation

Business customer submits bulk enquiry → admin reviews requirements → admin creates quotation → customer accepts → payment is collected → order is created and tracked.

